#: ../../tools/pdbepisa_tools.rst:32 eb4412b5b0d6420aa52d7bf408f0372d
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get predicted biological assemblies from a crystal "
"structure using PDBePISA. Analyzes crystal packing to predict the most "
"likely biological assembly (monomer, dimer, tetramer, etc.) with "
"stability scores, dissociation energy, accessible/buried surface areas, "
"and composition. Use after structure retrieval from RCSB/PDBe to "
"determine the biologically relevant oligomeric state. Positive "
"dissociation energy indicates a stable assembly."
msgstr ""

