#: ../../tools/pdbepisa_tools.rst:94 4e0d61899006438fa91d2decf0b7da8e
msgid ""
"**Description**: Analyze solvent-accessible surface area and interface "
"participation for each chain in a PDB structure using PDBePISA. Returns "
"per-chain total interface area, number of interface contacts, and "
"detailed interface participations. Useful for identifying which chains "
"are most involved in crystal contacts and protein interactions. Use with "
"RCSB/PDBe structure data and STRING network analysis."
